{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年46歲的拿督千金莊思敏（Jacquelin/莊鍶敏）日前為妹妹莊思明與楊明的婚禮擔任司儀，任務順利完成後她即刻大解放，換上超火辣比堅尼到泳池邊歎日光浴，大派福利。</p><figure><img alt=\"莊思敏超火辣藍豹紋比堅尼。（IG@jacquelinchng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260807/1162428171699097600102375.png/oO5effmzC4gYwgjMQTVa8tJpIWrfyx64R4h9sUeIfbE\"/><figcaption>莊思敏超火辣藍豹紋比堅尼。（IG@jacquelinchng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"歎日光浴。（IG@jacquelinchng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260807/1162428164572581888473219.png/PuwEAwAlAk8WQ94xMr8ZcRbog8FhcpQMwMAO0cDADtE\"/><figcaption>歎日光浴。（IG@jacquelinchng）</figcaption></figure><p>頂上做婚禮司儀講錯誓詞極烏龍</p><p>莊思明與楊明的婚禮現場原本感動溫馨，但臨時竟然找不到牧師。身為家姐的莊思敏只好臨危受命，親自頂上為一對新人主持宣誓環節。最爆笑的是，她在宣誓時竟然講錯誓詞，一開口就把新郎變成了「妻子」，令大婚現場秒變楊明「入贅」莊家的搞笑場面。</p><figure><img alt=\"莊思敏講錯誓詞把新郎變妻子。（IG@jacquelinchng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260807/1162429636353724416748269.jpeg/vQirNXLBeBI0vzMiRwTl29Od4tl9kqxhJnE0TCZxNEw\"/><figcaption>莊思敏講錯誓詞把新郎變妻子。（IG@jacquelinchng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"莊思敏身兼多職，既要招呼親戚朋友，又要兼顧大會流程。（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260807/1162221671436783616087432.jpeg/B50NkUV5XVTCSx34EdXI9Gm7F46CHdxpUwsnuWkLJ7k\"/><figcaption>莊思敏身兼多職，既要招呼親戚朋友，又要兼顧大會流程。（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><p>藍豹紋比堅尼大派福利</p><p>經歷完驚險又爆笑的司儀考驗後，莊思敏終於可以卸下重擔放鬆心情。她日前在社交平台分享影片，只見她換上一套藍紫色豹紋比堅尼，極具夏日清涼氣息，大騷驕人豐滿的上圍與纖細腰線，對著鏡頭燦爛甜笑並送上香吻，心情大好。之後她更移師到池邊的沙灘椅上，伸展手臂擺出誘人姿態享受日光浴，全方位展示完美身段，養眼指數爆燈。</p><figure><img alt=\"送上香吻。（IG@jacquelinchng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260807/1162428165356916736705429.png/Y4eFY-Z1986MZ0Ug8ki3Ns5wJtko-AXfp8TTdqfE03Y\"/><figcaption>送上香吻。（IG@jacquelinchng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Sexy！（IG@jacquelinchng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260807/1162428167273844736518627.png/gfNIV1g9l-V7JiYkBn6NWZmBIov_KZW5p8fR06fH0dM\"/><figcaption>Sexy！（IG@jacquelinchng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大騷性感身材。（IG@jacquelinchng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260807/1162428166816665600120958.png/j69yKJIrjb2RvB3kbeIbY32G6FRVdalo4Ja-K-CWvis\"/><figcaption>大騷性感身材。（IG@jacquelinchng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"莊思敏大派福利！（IG@jacquelinchng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260807/1162428162223640576520496.png/F6pbF1E8QzgxJC1KrYyv7ECY9UBpjReUq-_kRKvv5EQ\"/><figcaption>莊思敏大派福利！（IG@jacquelinchng）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T01:29:21.345068+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":600,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}